[2026-06-07T02:02:05.516Z] [INFO] 2026-06-07T02:02:05.516150Z  INFO session_loop{thread_id=019e9f80-05fc-7e51-bae7-d90a49713855}:submission_dispatch{otel.name="op.dispatch.user_input" submission.id="019e9f80-0711-73d3-ae77-f390ff890114" codex.op="user_input"}:turn{otel.name="session_task.turn" thread.id=019e9f80-05fc-7e51-bae7-d90a49713855 turn.id=019e9f80-0711-73d3-ae77-f390ff890114 model=gpt-5.5 codex.turn.reasoning_effort=xhigh}: codex_core::stream_events_utils: ToolCall: exec_command {"cmd":"gh pr edit 399 --repo link-assistant/formal-ai --body-file - <<'EOF'\n## Summary\n- Add recursive semantic facet/root seed coverage for issue 398, including Links-root ontology data, requirements and vision updates, and the case-study research artifacts under docs/case-studies/issue-398.\n- Migrate meaning seed data away from quoted prose fields into id-first LiNo facts using surfaces, source ids, and generated compatibility text only at read time.\n- Move lossless Wikidata snapshots into data/cache/wikidata as one .lino file per required entity or lexeme, remove the legacy data/seed/api-cache bundle, and add rerunnable Rust migration/conversion scripts.\n- Update parser, worker fallback seed loading, translation seed bridge, and data audits so the app reads the migrated format consistently.\n- Keep the CI file-size gate focused on editable Rust/LiNo files while excluding generated Wikidata source-cache snapshots that must remain one file per entity.\n- Teach e2e language audit scripts to parse the migrated LiNo syntax and unformalized-raw values while remaining compatible with old quoted files from the base ref.\n\n## Verification\n- quote grep over data/seed and data/cache returned no matches\n- old-field grep for gloss, description, meaning, and word seed records returned no matches\n- rustc scripts/migrate-meaning-seed.rs -o /tmp/migrate-meaning-seed && /tmp/migrate-meaning-seed\n- node --check src/web/formal_ai_worker.js && node --check src/web/seed_loader.js\n- node --check tests/e2e/scripts/lino-seed-parser.mjs\n- node --check tests/e2e/scripts/check-language-change-parity.mjs\n- node --check tests/e2e/scripts/check-language-test-coverage.mjs\n- node --check tests/e2e/scripts/check-multilingual-intent-coverage.mjs\n- GITHUB_BASE_REF=main npm run --prefix tests/e2e check:language-parity\n- GITHUB_BASE_REF=main npm run --prefix tests/e2e check:language-test-coverage\n- npm run --prefix tests/e2e check:intent-coverage\n- cargo test --test unit data_files -- --nocapture\n- cargo test\n- cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features\n- cargo fmt --all -- --check\n- rust-script scripts/check-file-size.rs\n- rust-script --test scripts/check-file-size.rs\n- git diff --check\n\nNo screenshot attached because this change is semantic seed/parser/cache behavior, not visual UI work.\nEOF","workdir":"/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1780792414071","yield_time_ms":1000,"max_output_tokens":4000} thread_id=019e9f80-05fc-7e51-bae7-d90a49713855
